# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
The purpose of this research plan is to provide a framework for understanding the impact of sustainable fashion practices on the environment. This revised version takes into account feedback from previous cycles and updates the methodology for data collection.<br>
